      "text": "[#](53341a)Offer barn and field bait: a milk bucket, hay bale, apple, beef, cod, red mushroom, carrot, and seeds, plus **6000 altar power**. It favors pigs, chickens, cows, sheep, mooshrooms, wolves, and ocelots.[#]()",
